      "id": "claim_17f3a5d2a8d547da8addcf59bb200c31",
      "statement": "`createLwsAuthFetch` performs the two-step LWS chain: a DPoP-bound request to the UAS token endpoint for one ID-JAG per storage authorization server (keyed by issuer, storage, and impersonation UAS), then a bearer ID-JAG exchange at the storage for an access token, then the storage request with one retry on `401`.",
